@host = http://localhost:5119
@apiKey = gh_agent_key_0001

### Chat (streaming SSE) — Tool-enabled: Ask about a specific ticket
# The model calls the GetTicketById tool, retrieves real ticket data, and
# generates a response referencing actual details. The stream pauses while
# the tool executes, then resumes with grounded content.
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "What's the status of ticket 1001? Who is it assigned to?"
}

### Chat (streaming SSE) — Tool DISABLED: Same question, no tool access
# Without the tool, the model either confabulates ticket details or says
# it doesn't have access to ticket data. Compare with the request above.
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream?useTools=false
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "What's the status of ticket 1001? Who is it assigned to?"
}

### Chat (non-streaming) — Tool-enabled: Ticket lookup
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Give me the details of ticket 1005, including any comments."
}

### Chat (non-streaming) — Grounded response with RAG (existing behavior)
# RAG still works alongside tools. This question is answered from the
# knowledge base — no tool call needed.
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "My VPN keeps timing out after MFA approval. What should I check first?"
}

### Chat (streaming SSE) — Grounded streaming response (RAG only)
# The streaming endpoint also retrieves knowledge base articles before generating.
# Tokens arrive incrementally with content referencing real Globomatics procedures.
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "My VPN keeps timing out after MFA approval. What should I check first?"
}

### Chat — Another grounded example (RAG)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "What is the process for requesting a new laptop?"
}

### Chat (streaming) — Email sync issue (RAG)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "I can't get my email to sync on my phone. What should I try?"
}
